            "item_desc": "<p>\nAs we celebrate 70 years of Ella Baché, I would like to thank you for being a part of our journey and our future. Whether you’re discovering our products for the first time, or have been a part of our community throughout the years, we remain dedicated to helping you love the skin you’re in. Our story began when my great aunt, Madame Baché, a pioneering chemist in Paris, revolutionised skincare by rejecting a one-size fits all approach. She believed in treating each person’s skin as unique, understanding its condition at a cellular level.<\/p>",
